descriptionByLocale.en:
Medacta International SA wishes to avail itself of a Operator to be inserted in the Tornitura department.

The resource will have to deal with the proper conduct of numerical control lathes. It will follow the entire mechanical processing cycle, setting machine edge parameters, placing and equipping, processing execution and testing of the component.

Technical skills:

- technical diploma;
- good knowledge of mechanical design;
- knowledge of measuring instruments (caliber, micrometer);
- previous experience in the role will be considered a plus;
- knowledge of the language Fanuc and Mitsubishi will be considered a plus;
- tool presetting capacity and machine setup will be considered a plus;

Transversal skills:

- precision, punctuality and accuracy in the execution of the assigned works;
- preparing for teamwork;
- good problem solving skills;
- hours on shifts: different shifts are planned, defined during initial interview (3 shifts, night only).

What we offer:

- contract indefinitely;
- carpooling organized by Medacta;
- incentives for mobility with public transport;
- advantageous business conventions;
- growth opportunities, working in an environment in continuous improvement and expansion;
- Annual review of the salary related to performance and professional development;
- continuing training.

Medacta International is an employer offering equal opportunities. Qualified candidates will be considered for use without taking into account race, ethnicity, color, religion, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, national origin, disability or status of protected veteran.

descriptionByLocale.de:
